<p style="margin:0 0 16px">Hi <%= @employee.first_name %>,</p>

<h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;color:#111827">Your salary slip for <%= @period %></h2>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#374151">
  Your salary slip from <%= @company_name %> is attached as a PDF. If anything on it looks wrong, please contact your HR team.
</p>

<p style="margin:0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-size:12px;color:#6b7280">
  The slip is confidential — please don't forward it.
</p>
